      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My gray brain-meat had an idea. I bet I could\nmake a fortune with a sludge-cleaning business!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I caught myself a Clauncher since it’s good at\nthe move Water Gun. We’re all set!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Except we’re not!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nClauncher’s not interested in washing away the\nsludge at all!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
